          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Dakók looloqooseek gawaá daanduú tlawi, as ma'aay niwa ki/iya' gawaá múk Misri, nee gawaá gaarduuín, nee gawaá mukdá' gaardaá madiít!» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose dakós guri looloqoós gawaá daanduú tláwtí ale. Nee looa niwa tleér, ma'aá tlawi niri dinkwár i ki/iyé' ar /uuru. Múk Misri iri ta'aaín geeraá tlawtá wa ale, ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ slaqwaruusér Misri gari hhaamiís baraá tla/ángw tlawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma'aydá' niri ki/iyé', gaardu ngiri tuuntuukiyé', nee mukdá' gaardaá madiita, nee slaqwaruuse sleémeero ar Farao, tidá' múk Israeli gwaa aluú wa eehat, tlawi giri gú/, tam heé wák oo aa kotsqoot i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Israeli ina hi'iimiít ar baraá yaamaá kaahaar baraá tla/ángw tlawto. Nee ma'aydá' niri koo/i tleehhitiyé' bihhaaín awa doó /iyáy nee awa doó basayhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
